	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event2_react_enemy_0">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>モニカ『いやに　すなおね……▼
でも　ほんとに　わるいと
おもってるの　かしら……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-26T09:55:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-26T09:55:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>モニカ『いやに　素直ね……▼
でも　ほんとに　悪いと
思ってるの　かしら……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-26T09:55:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-26T09:55:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event2_react_hero_1">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『そうだっけ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-20T06:30:02" />
