	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event6_enemy_1">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>モニカ『サヨナラ　[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]……
もう　にどと　あうことは　ないわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-26T09:55:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-26T09:55:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>モニカ『サヨナラ　[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]……
もう　二度と　合うことは　ないわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-26T09:55:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
